        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Rianra kapmei zaengthak puibam;",
            "Panti neikeimei paengthang,",
            "Aini guangbam ni hei khou tei",
            "Khou tei aniu lungcham khang.",
            "",
            "2. Rianrana chaeng maan tatmei guai",
            "Kaipou khou ngalan guang tho;",
            "Nchummei chaeng guang khou gut tho,",
            "Kachaek namdai chaeng kiu e.",
            "",
            "3. Neikeipui gan tingzin guang the,",
            "Kaitat khang kamthau dikho;",
            "Neikeilouna zingguang pukhou,",
            "Nangta kau handat lak khe.",
            "",
            "4. Tingkao kachaek tingthan patna",
            "Zianmei guai guang kariuna,",
            "Seraphim guai lungpui ram khou",
            "Aniu guang bamcham datni."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
